{"id":341,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It was originally a Pokémon from afar that escaped to the wild. It can adapt to the dirtiest river."},{"games":["Sword","X","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"No matter how dirty the water in the river, it will adapt and thrive. It has a strong will to survive."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It can adapt very well to its environment. Feebas and Corphish are about the only Pokémon to live in stagnant ditches."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Individuals that have been set free by Trainers who could no longer raise them have become common, and they can now be found in Alola."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Corphish catches prey with its sharp claws. It has no likes or dislikes when it comes to food—it will eat anything. This Pokémon has no trouble living in filthy water."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Corphish were originally foreign Pokémon that were imported as pets. They eventually turned up in the wild. This Pokémon is very hardy and has greatly increased its population."},{"games":["Y","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Its hardy vitality enables it to adapt to any environment. Its pincers will never release prey."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It came from overseas. It is a very hardy creature that will quickly proliferate, even in polluted streams."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Once it grips prey with its large pincers, it will never let go, no matter what. It is a hardy POKéMON that can thrive in any environment."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Hyper Cutter","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's prized, mighty pincers prevent other Pokémon from lowering its Attack stat."},{"name":"Shell Armor","hidden":false,"description":"A hard shell protects the Pokémon from critical hits."},{"name":"Adaptability","hidden":true,"description":"Powers up moves of the same type as the Pokémon."}],"eggGroups":["Water 1","Water 3"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fluctuating","habitat":"water's edge","color":"Red","shape":"Armor","evolution":{"id":341,"name":"Corphish","condition":null,"children":[{"id":342,"name":"Crawdaunt","condition":"Lv. 30","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,55],[1,106],[4,43],[8,269],[12,61],[16,282],[20,458],[24,182],[28,400],[32,534],[36,14],[40,242],[44,152],[48,283],[52,12]],"machine":[59,34,280,886,242,91,38,349,283,203,263,206,374,56,58,196,334,282,710,232,341,330,182,240,156,157,317,214,188,164,57,14,36,269,851,168,352,127,250,404],"egg":[246,453,38,232,163,415],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me1-33","name":"Corphish","set":"Mega Evolution","date":"2025-09-26","rarity":"Common","number":"33","artist":null,"img":"me1/33"},{"id":"sv6-47","name":"Corphish","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Common","number":"47","artist":"Kouki Saitou","img":"sv6/47"},{"id":"swsh12pt5-33","name":"Corphish","set":"Crown Zenith","date":"2023-01-20","rarity":"Common","number":"33","artist":"0313","img":"swsh12pt5/33"},{"id":"swsh9-32","name":"Corphish","set":"Brilliant Stars","date":"2022-02-25","rarity":"Common","number":"32","artist":"Sekio","img":"swsh9/32"},{"id":"swsh5-38","name":"Corphish","set":"Battle Styles","date":"2021-03-19","rarity":"Common","number":"38","artist":"chibi","img":"swsh5/38"},{"id":"sm4-24","name":"Corphish","set":"Crimson Invasion","date":"2017-11-03","rarity":"Common","number":"24","artist":"Masakazu Fukuda","img":"sm4/24"},{"id":"xy5-42","name":"Corphish","set":"Primal Clash","date":"2015-02-04","rarity":"Common","number":"42","artist":"Shin Nagasawa","img":"xy5/42"},{"id":"pl3-100","name":"Corphish","set":"Supreme Victors","date":"2009-08-19","rarity":"Common","number":"100","artist":"Hajime Kusajima","img":"pl3/100"},{"id":"dp6-89","name":"Corphish","set":"Legends Awakened","date":"2008-08-01","rarity":"Common","number":"89","artist":"Sumiyoshi Kizuki","img":"dp6/89"},{"id":"ex13-62","name":"C